I will execute this patch. This is the smallest justified change to resolve the admission rejection while keeping the image, args, and other configurations intact.

The events clearly explain the `CreateContainerConfigError`. The warning message states:

`Warning Failed 8s (x7 over 77s) kubelet spec.containers{app}: Error: container has runAsNonRoot and image will run as root (pod: "app-5dcbf687b-qhzvz_restricted-app(425aba0b-96ef-4fc4-bb4a-7f658adf4499)", container: app)`

This confirms that even though I patched the deployment to include `runAsNonRoot: true`, the specific image (`busybox:1.37.0`) defaults to running as root, and the Kubelet is refusing to start the container because the specified security context (`runAsNonRoot: true`) contradicts the image's behavior (running as root).

The `security` skill states:
> `runAsNonRoot: true` alone is not enough when the image's default user is root or unspecified: the kubelet refuses to start the container with a `CreateContainerConfigError` about running as root. Set a non-zero `runAsUser` (for example `65532`) or choose a non-root image.

Since I cannot change the image easily (and I am constrained to make the smallest justified change), the required fix is to specify a non-root user (`runAsUser`) in the security context. I will use `65532` (a common non-root UID).

I need to patch the deployment again, modifying the security context to include `runAsUser`. I will keep the previous successful patches (seccomp, capabilities, etc.) and add `runAsUser`.

The original patch attempt included `runAsNonRoot: true`. If I add `runAsUser`, `runAsNonRoot` becomes redundant but safe to keep. I will include all required elements, adding `runAsUser: 65532`.

New Patch Payload:
```json
{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "securityContext": {
              "allowPrivilegeEscalation": false,
              "capabilities": {
                "drop": ["ALL"]
              },
              "runAsNonRoot": true,
              "runAsUser": 65532, 
              "seccompProfile": {
                "type": "RuntimeDefault"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
I will execute this final patch.

